rem The Chase
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=227
rem Find the expected number of turns
rem until two dice on opposite sides of
rem a circle of N players meet

use linalg
use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 100

rem Only the distance d between the dice
rem matters. Each die goes one way, the
rem other way or stays, with chances
rem 1/6, 1/6 and 4/6, so d changes by
rem -2..2 with chances 1, 8, 18, 8, 1
rem out of 36, folded onto 0..N/2.
rem With Q the moves among the states
rem 1..N/2, the times E solve
rem (I - Q) E = 1.
H = N // 2
D = 0 to H array
Step = -2 to 2 array
Pr = array 1 8 18 8 1
Col' = D reshape (H + 1) 1
Off = (Col + Step) mod N
Fold' = N - Off
Dn' = Off Fold min
Dc' = Dn reshape (H + 1) 5 1
Hit' = Dc equal (D reshape 1 1 (H + 1))
Wt' = Pr reshape 1 5 1
Mv' = (Hit choose 1 0) * Wt
P' = Mv sum axis 1
Rows' = P drop 1
Cols' = Rows transpose drop 1 transpose
Q' = Cols / 36.0
Ks = 1 to H array
Eye' = (Ks reshape H 1) equal Ks
I' = Eye choose 1.0 0.0
E = (I - Q) (Ks - Ks + 1.0) solve
Answer = E (H - 1) 6 round
Answer print
